---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="kiran haber :: systems">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="project">
      <a href="https://github.com/missioncreep11/rtk-wave-buoy">RTK Wave Buoy</a>
      <p>
        An open-source, centimeter-precise GNSS wave buoy I'm contributing to as part of my internship at Scripps Institution of 
        Oceanography's <a href="https://www.mod.ucsd.edu/">MOD Lab.</a> I've engineered a new antenna mount, developed a Bluetooth LE 
        serial comms driver, and designed/implemented a telemetry pipeline that automatically forwards buoy data over LTE to a 
        Cloudflare Worker, which triggers a GitHub Action that updates a web dashboard for real-time viewing. I'm currently updating the
        project documentation to improve readability and maintainability across the project.
      </p>
      <span class="meta">RTK, GNSS, C++, ESP32, I2C</span>
    </div>
    <div class="project">
      <strong>Orchid watering system <span class="in-progress">(in progress)</span></strong>
      <p>
        A Raspberry Pi powered smart irrigation setup. Reads moisture of my plant daily via a capacitive sensor and administers water if
        needed. I'm in the process of adding a lightweight Flask server for the purpose of posting log data to a dashboard.
      </p>
      <span class="meta">GPIO, SPI, Python, Linux</span>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
      <strong>Kindle dashboard <span class="in-progress">(in progress)</span></strong>
      <p>
        Running Alpine Linux on an 8th Gen. Kindle. Besides reading, I'll be using this to display my irrigation system's logs at home along
        with anything else I might want to know.
      </p>
      <span class="meta">Linux, e-ink</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .content {
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .project {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .project a {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .project p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .in-progress {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-meta);
  }
</style>
